{"unit_id":"tag:03N4:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于恒等映射（identity）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism），我们可以计算平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）层（sheaf）的整体截面（global sections），而上同调（cohomology）就是相应的右导出函子（derived functors）。换言之，在发展更多理论并使陈述精确之后，定义上同调（cohomology）将没有障碍。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"右导出函子"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"候选译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"右导出函子","context":"保留原文 right 限定，候选译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
